{
  "name": "item_sorter",
  "description": "Two slices of the standard hopper item sorter under a line of hoppers fed from a chest holding iron ingots, gold ingots and cobblestone, three of each, in turn. Each filter hopper holds 41 of its item and a stick in every other slot, so its comparator reads 2. A 42nd item makes it 3, which carries along two dust and a repeater to the block holding a redstone torch; the torch goes out, unlocking the hopper below the filter for one pull before the torch relights. Iron and gold end up in their slices' chests (each locked hopper keeps the last one it pulled until the next arrives), and the cobblestone passes on to the chest at the end of the line.",
